-- A 2005 music player skin: brushed aluminium, a glowing green LCD, chrome transport buttons, an aqua play button,
-- glossy window lights, a striped playlist. Lit, not flat: the metal catches the light as the piece tilts.
-- Laid out with words: the panels are placed, everything inside them is put in, under or beside them.
Let there be a canvas called player-skin, 1600 by 1000, from aluminium.
Brush the card at 0 degrees.
Let text be in Jost, size 24.
Let an lcd-text be in Martian Mono, size 22, aligned left, #27331a.

-- the window
Let there be a rectangle called body, 1520 by 920, corners 34, at 800 500.
Make the body #d9dce1.
Give the body an outline in #8d939c, 3 wide.
Let there be a rectangle called titlebar, 1520 by 70, corners 34, in the body, at the top.
Make the titlebar a gradient from #f4f5f7 to #b9bec6, angled 90.
Write "Morgana Player" called title in Jost bold, size 30, in the titlebar.
Make the title #3a3f47.
Give the title a shadow, 1 down, blur 0, in #ffffff, 90% opacity.

-- window lights
Let there be 3 circles called light, 13 big, in a row, 36 apart, from 0 0, in the titlebar, at the left, 30 in.
Make the first light a radial gradient from #ff8a80 to #c62828.
Make the second light a radial gradient from #ffe082 to #f9a825.
Make the third light a radial gradient from #a5d6a7 to #2e7d32.
Give the lights an outline in #00000055, 1 wide.
Give the lights an inner shadow, 3 up, blur 4, in #ffffff, 60% opacity.

-- the LCD
Let there be a rectangle called lcd, 760 by 210, corners 18, at 800 245.
Make the lcd a gradient from #d8e8b8 to #a9c47f, angled 90.
Give the lcd an inner shadow, 6 down, blur 14, 55% opacity.
Give the lcd an outline in #6d7a5a, 2 wide.
Write "LANTERNS" called song as an lcd-text, size 42, tracking 4, in the lcd, at the top left, 30 in.
Write "Vesper Lane — Ember Season" called artist as an lcd-text, under the song, 14 apart.
Let there be a rectangle called track, 520 by 10, corners 5, in the lcd, at the bottom, 34 in.
Let there be a rectangle called played, 340 by 10, corners 5, in the track, at the left.
Write "2:41" called elapsed as an lcd-text, left of the track, 16 apart.
Write "-1:26" called remaining as an lcd-text, beside the track, 16 apart.
Make the track #27331a, 80% see-through.
Make the played #27331a.
Let there be 8 rectangles called eq, 10 by 44, in a row, 16 apart, from 0 0, in the lcd, at the top right, 30 in.
Make the eqs #27331a, 25% see-through.
Make every other eq #27331a.

-- album art, to the left of the LCD
Let there be a rectangle called art, 200 by 200, corners 10, left of the lcd, 80 apart.
Print @hallows.jpg in the art, focused at 0.33 0.42.
Give the art a shadow, 8 down, blur 18, 50% opacity.
Give the art an outline in #ffffff, 3 wide.

-- transport: chrome buttons, aqua play, to the right of the LCD
Let there be a circle called play, 62 big, beside the lcd, 105 apart.
Let there be a circle called prev, 46 big, left of the play, 6 apart.
Let there be a circle called next, 46 big, beside the play, 6 apart.
Make the prev and the next mirror chrome.
Emboss the prev, 0.25 mm high, soft 0.6.
Emboss the next, 0.25 mm high, soft 0.6.
Make the play a radial gradient from #a7dcff to #1565c0.
Give the play an outline in #0d3c78, 2 wide.
Emboss the play, 0.35 mm high, soft 0.5.
Spray the play with gloss, 40 µm thick.
Let there be a triangle called play-icon, 22 big, pointing right, in the play.
Let there be a triangle called prev-icon, 13 big, pointing left, in the prev.
Let there be a triangle called next-icon, 13 big, pointing right, in the next.
Make the play-icon #ffffff.
Make the prev-icon and the next-icon #3a3f47.

-- volume, under the buttons
Let there be a rectangle called groove, 300 by 10, corners 5, under the play, 34 apart.
Deboss the groove, 0.06 mm deep.
Make the groove #8d939c.
Let there be a circle called knob, 17 big, in the groove, at the right, 60 in.
Make the knob mirror chrome.
Emboss the knob, 0.3 mm high, soft 0.5.

-- the playlist
Let there be a rectangle called list, 1440 by 470, corners 14, at 800 655.
Make the list #ffffff.
Give the list an inner shadow, 3 down, blur 8, 40% opacity.
Let there be a table called playlist, 1436 by 448, at 800 650, 8 rows, columns at 28, 78, 818 and 1398 right, in Jost, size 24.
Write "1", "Lanterns", "Vesper Lane", "4:07" in the next row of the playlist.
Write "2", "Hollow", "Vesper Lane", "3:52" in the next row of the playlist.
Write "3", "Ember Season", "Vesper Lane", "5:10" in the next row of the playlist.
Write "4", "Paper Moon", "Vesper Lane", "3:38" in the next row of the playlist.
Write "5", "Candle Hour", "Vesper Lane", "4:21" in the next row of the playlist.
Write "6", "Late October", "Vesper Lane", "2:59" in the next row of the playlist.
Make every other playlist-row #edf3fb.
Make the third playlist-row a gradient from #4a90e2 to #2a6fc4, angled 90.
Make the playlist-words #2b3036.
Make the third playlist-words white.

-- status bar
Write "6 songs · 24.1 minutes · 58.3 MB" called status, size 22, under the list, 20 apart.
Make the status #5b616a.
